* -----------------------------------------------------------------
* DFSORT CONTROL CARDS: FILTER_ELIGIBLE.SRT
* PURPOSE: SPLIT PROCESSED ELIGIBILITY RECORDS INTO ELIGIBLE AND
*          REJECTED SUB-STREAMS USING OUTFIL
* RECORD FORMAT: FB, LRECL=120
* FIELD POSITIONS IN ELIGIBILITY RECORD:
*   ELG-STATUS: POS 40, LEN 1, CHARACTER
*     'E' = ELIGIBLE
*     'R' = REJECTED
* -----------------------------------------------------------------
 SORT FIELDS=COPY
 OUTFIL FNAMES=SORTOUT1,INCLUDE=(40,1,CH,EQ,C'E')
 OUTFIL FNAMES=SORTOUT2,INCLUDE=(40,1,CH,EQ,C'R')
 END
